            "prompt": "Complete FULLY OPAQUE portrait4:5 storybook illustration, target1280x1600. All pixels alpha255/opaque, no transparent edges, no cutouts or atlas. Cozy dimensional gently brushed digitalpainting, detailed natural materials, coherent upperleftsunshine andperspective. No words, labels, logos, landmarks, people,UI,frame orwatermark. Attractivefinishedcleanbackground forlaterdetail layers, noholes. A cozyfabricshop with beautifulfoldedcloth andhangingribbons, close3/4view. CORAL PINK dominatespaintedplasterwalls, largecuttingtablecover andmostfabricfolds, smallivoryandteal accents. Wooden shelveswithdistinctclothpatterns, brassscissorsandmeasuringtape withoutnumbers, foldedpinktextiles. Widewoodcrossbeamupperquarterhasemptyhookleftx24%,y22% forlaterclothpennant. Rightupperpegx78%,y30% forlater narrowtassel. Tablefrontsmallopenbudvase nearx83%,y74%. Smallplantpotleftmid x13%,y61% hasbarebranch. A tied ivoryfabricbundle frontcenterx46%,y75% hasplaincord no bow. Fiveomittedparts: creamcoralpennant, thintealtassel, pinkflowersteminvase, rootedoliveleafsprig, smallcream bowonfabricbundle. No fakefloating fabrics.",
